\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 ## 2. Spoilage Decay ($F_\{decay\}$)
\f1\b0 \cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 An exponential decay curve over the time-to-expiry timeline, scaled by the perishability coefficient ($\cf7 \strokec7 P\cf4 \strokec4 $):\cb1 \
\cb3 $$\cf7 \strokec7 F_\{decay\} = e^\{-\cf6 \strokec6 0.25\cf7 \strokec7  \cf2 \strokec2 \\times\cf7 \strokec7  \cf2 \strokec2 \\\cf8 \strokec8 frac\cf7 \strokec7 \{\cf2 \strokec2 \\\cf8 \strokec8 text\cf7 \strokec7 \{DaysToExpiry\}\}\{P\}\}\cf4 \strokec4 $$\cb1 \
